  "description": "Hong Nana, owner of Ilgwang Laundry, believed that in filthy, desire-soaked Suyang District, the only person she could trust was Lee Eunchang. At least… until he used her as collateral for a loan, emptied the safe, and ran away. Kim Heerak, an enforcer of the Chilseong gang, and the boss of the Palpal Nightclub. In this insignificant, rundown neighborhood, Nana was the only person who had ever piqued his interest. And just when he was waiting for the right moment, Lee Eunchang disappeared with the safe. A relationship that began as repayment of debt with her own body. In the dark back alleys where betrayal waits at every corner, can Kim Heerak really be a man she can trust?\nSource: MU",
